'''Comfey''' (Japanese: '''キュワワー''' ''Cuwawa'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

