==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Comfey|93}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
*{{m|Flower Shield}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Comfey}} can learn.
*'''Spinning Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vending|Staryu|S3}} from {{TCG|Expansion Sheet 3}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

